{
  "info": {
    "name": "CampusMart · 用户模块自测",
    "description": "Week01 Day6 回归测试集合。\n\n【使用前必读】\n1. 先启动 Spring Boot 服务（默认 http://localhost:8080）\n2. 按目录顺序从上往下跑，00 组会先登录并把 token 存进集合变量\n3. ADMIN 账号依赖：mtest0917 / 123456（需已存在且 role=ADMIN）\n4. 上传头像的 3 条用例需要手动选择文件，见该目录下的说明\n5. 「正常注册」用 {{$timestamp}} 生成用户名，可反复跑；其余注册用例用了固定名字，重跑时会返回 1001（用户名已存在）—— 这是正常的，恰好说明接口不幂等\n\n【环境变量】\nbaseUrl      http://localhost:8080\ntestUser     普通用户用户名（00 组注册）\nadminToken   管理员 token（00 组自动填充）\nuserToken    普通用户 token（00 组自动填充）\nmyUserId     普通用户 id（03 组自动填充）\nadminId      管理员 id（默认 11，如你的库不同请改）",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "testUser", "value": "apifox_user" },
    { "key": "adminToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "userToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "myUserId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "adminId", "value": "11" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 · 准备（先跑这一组）",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "0.1 登录管理员 → 存 adminToken",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.code === 0) { pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', j.data); }",
                  "pm.test('登录成功 code=0', function () { pm.expect(j.code).to.eql(0); });",
                  "if (j.code !== 0) { console.log('管理员登录失败，请确认 mtest0917 / 123456 存在且是 ADMIN'); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"username\":\"mtest0917\",\"password\":\"123456\"}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["user", "login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "0.2 注册普通用户（首次 0 / 重跑 1001）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"username\":\"{{testUser}}\",\"password\":\"123456\",\"nickname\":\"接口测试号\"}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["user", "register"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "0.3 登录普通用户 → 存 userToken",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.code === 0) { pm.collectionVariables.set('userToken', j.data); }",
                  "pm.test('登录成功 code=0', function () { pm.expect(j.code).to.eql(0); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"username\":\"{{testUser}}\",\"password\":\"123456\"}", "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } } },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/user/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["user", "login"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
